# Ambient: a slow pad style at ~70, written for Polly over C M7 (no drums in A; a little percussion in B).
# Main A: two pads on Chord 2 breathing in turn (a warm pad on the bar, a halo pad entering on beat 3 and
# held into the next), a soft celesta arpeggio on Chord 1, a sub bass holding the root.
# Main B: a shaker and a triangle, the arpeggio in a second voice an octave up, the pads up.
# The ending holds the root chord and fades.
style Ambient
tempo 70

track d1 type=bypass chan=10 vol=100 rev=90
track d2 type=bypass chan=10 vol=100 rev=90   # shares channel 10 with d1: the same mixer
track pc type=bypass chan=10 vol=100 rev=90
track ba type=bass program=38 chan=2 lo=C1 hi=C3 hikey=F# vol=120 rev=30
track c1 type=chord1 program=8 chan=3 lo=G4 hi=G6 hikey=F# vol=96 pan=44 rev=110 cho=30
track c2 type=chord2 program=94 chan=4 lo=G3 hi=E5 vol=88 pan=84 rev=110 cho=60
track c3 type=chord2 program=89 chan=5 lo=E3 hi=C5 vol=94 pan=40 rev=110 cho=40
track c4 type=chord1 program=11 chan=6 lo=C5 hi=C7 hikey=F# vol=80 pan=76 rev=120

